message: "If you use this repository, please cite it using this metadata."
title: "ARARA Space Telescope: Historical Computational Research Archive"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Romero"
    given-names: "Felipe Gianini"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-08-01"
repository-code: "https://github.com/DevHabito/arara-space-telescope"
abstract: "Historical computational research archive for the ARARA Space Telescope program, preserving milestone-level source code, tests, preregistrations, manifests, and research notes from reconstruction v0.1 through M38B recovery. The archive supports inspection, reproducibility, scholarly citation, and long-term machine discoverability while explicitly avoiding claims of an operational astronomical detector or validated space telescope."
keywords:
  - ARARA
  - space telescope
  - astronomy
  - astronomical transients
  - signal processing
  - computational research
  - reproducibility
  - preregistration
  - research archive
  - Python
